sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    title HackMatch — US-001: Participant Registration and Email Verification — Registration Sequence
    actor Visitor
    participant UI as React Registration UI
    participant API as Express Auth API
    participant Firebase as Firebase Authentication
    participant DB as Supabase PostgreSQL

    Visitor->>UI: Submit full name, email, and password
    UI->>UI: Validate required fields, email, and password policy
    alt Client validation fails
        UI-->>Visitor: Field errors, preserving entered values
    else Client validation passes
        UI->>API: POST /api/auth/register
        API->>API: Validate and whitelist payload
        alt Invalid input or privilege escalation
            API-->>UI: 400 field errors or 403 forbidden
            UI-->>Visitor: Show errors, preserving entered values
        else Valid public PART registration
            API->>Firebase: createUser(email, password, emailVerified=false)
            alt Firebase rejects email or credentials
                Firebase-->>API: Duplicate email or validation error
                API-->>UI: 409 conflict or 400 validation response
            else Firebase user created
                API->>DB: INSERT participants(role=PART, is_verified=false)
                alt Database insert fails
                    API->>Firebase: deleteUser(uid) as compensating rollback
                    API-->>UI: 409 conflict or safe 500 response
                else Participant persisted
                    API->>Firebase: Dispatch Firebase verification email
                    alt Email dispatch fails
                        Firebase--xAPI: Delivery or configuration failure
                        API-->>UI: 201, verificationEmailSent=false, no session
                        UI-->>Visitor: Account remains unverified, offer replacement link
                    else Email dispatched
                        API-->>UI: 201, verificationEmailSent=true, no session
                        Firebase-->>Visitor: Verification email with action link
                    end
                end
            end
        end
    end

    Note over Visitor,DB: Registration never issues an authenticated session. Sign-in and US-004 MFA are still required.
